  "skill_summaries": {
    "ultimate": "Passive: active score increases ATK and Haste; Active: create silencing domain, then multi-hit target",
    "skill1": "three-hit strike dealing damage and draining enemy energy",
    "skill2": "control then area knock down burst",
    "skill3": "battle haste increase",
    "skill4": "once score activates, auto-play cleanses debuffs and recovers HP and energy",
    "skill5": "enhanced attacks true damage life drain"
  },
  "play_overview": "[[Sylphira]] builds an **active score** that raises ATK and Haste, then unleashes a silencing domain followed by multi-hit strikes. A three-hit skill drains enemy Energy on each connect, while another skill chains control into an area knockdown. Once the score activates, automatic plays cleanse debuffs and recover HP and Energy, keeping [[Sylphira]] self-sufficient through extended fights. Enhanced attacks add true damage and Life Drain between ultimate windows. She combines control, silence, and sustain, but unaffected or silence-immune foes deny much of that disruption.",
  "counter_overview": "[[Sylphira]]'s score takes time to activate; once active, Haste, self-cleanse, Energy recovery, Life Drain, and true damage make attrition poor. Do not bank on CC or an ult interrupt during her Unaffected or control-immune casts. Pressure the pre-score window with high-damage melee like [[Himmel]] or [[Zandrok]], then cut recovery with [[filter:heal-inhibitor]] like [[Frieren]] or [[Gwyneth]]. If she reaches score, use lasting damage and pressure support rather than feeding a control chain."
}
